{"key": "f14f1334fbe1e0630861ed915516bd2bd862e8215e2f3adfa933162352ab5aac", "input": {"format": "json", "source_type": "official_transcript", "selector": null, "encoding": null, "cached_pages": null, "cache_file_key": null, "country_iso3": "NLD", "year": 2020, "source_sha256": "e88d92f915545311a8724c3c8c16809fbfc02e6cdf1eaa1ee2f1bf8bce394fe1", "adapter_version": "1.2-canonical-transcript-locators"}, "blocks": [["Mr President, Secretary-General, Your Excellencies, ladies and gentlemen, [PM]", {"paragraph": 1, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 4, "bbox": [151.71, 136.5, 491.02, 149.97], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["For me, the General Assembly in New York is the ultimate UN experience.", {"paragraph": 2, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 5, "bbox": [151.71, 154.71, 478.4, 168.18], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["All the delegations gathered in that imposing hall during the General Debate.", {"paragraph": 3, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 6, "bbox": [151.71, 172.93, 489.05, 186.4], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["The whole world coming together.", {"paragraph": 4, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 7, "bbox": [151.71, 191.15, 300.83, 204.62], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["There’s nothing like it.", {"paragraph": 5, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 8, "bbox": [151.71, 209.36, 251.03, 222.83], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["But this year, everything is different.", {"paragraph": 6, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 9, "bbox": [151.71, 227.58, 313.73, 241.05], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["For the first time in history we’re having a virtual Assembly.", {"paragraph": 7, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 10, "bbox": [151.71, 245.79, 417.65, 259.26], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["It feels a bit surreal, and it’s far from ideal, but it’s important — despite the restrictions — that we share our views on the international situation.", {"paragraph": 8, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 11, "bbox": [123.36, 264.01, 493.52, 289.7], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Especially this year.", {"paragraph": 9, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 12, "bbox": [151.71, 294.44, 239.77, 307.91], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Because this is the year of coronavirus.", {"paragraph": 10, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 13, "bbox": [151.71, 312.66, 323.48, 326.13], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["The impact on our health, our economies and our societies has been enormous.", {"paragraph": 11, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 14, "bbox": [151.71, 330.88, 491.04, 344.35], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Almost every country in the world, including the European and Caribbean parts of the Kingdom of the Netherlands, has been hit hard.", {"paragraph": 12, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 15, "bbox": [123.36, 349.09, 493.6, 374.78], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["The poorest countries hardest of all.", {"paragraph": 13, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 16, "bbox": [151.71, 379.53, 309.28, 393.0], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Existing problems have been magnified by the pandemic.", {"paragraph": 14, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 17, "bbox": [151.71, 397.74, 402.03, 411.21], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["And this has forced us to face facts: in times of crisis we have to work together.", {"paragraph": 15, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 18, "bbox": [151.71, 415.96, 490.97, 429.43], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Look out for each other.", {"paragraph": 16, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 19, "bbox": [151.71, 434.17, 256.34, 447.64], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Support one another.", {"paragraph": 17, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 20, "bbox": [151.71, 452.39, 242.38, 465.86], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Not only our families, neighbours and compatriots, but also other countries and peoples, regardless of the borders between us.", {"paragraph": 18, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 21, "bbox": [123.36, 470.61, 493.57, 496.29], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Because we’re all in this together.", {"paragraph": 19, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 22, "bbox": [151.71, 501.04, 299.13, 514.51], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["The UN is setting the right example.", {"paragraph": 20, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 23, "bbox": [151.71, 519.26, 311.09, 532.73], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Not least by setting up the UN COVID-19 Response and Recovery Fund, initiated by Secretary-General Guterres.", {"paragraph": 21, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 24, "bbox": [123.36, 537.47, 493.56, 563.16], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["The Netherlands fully supports the Fund, and so far we’re its biggest donor.", {"paragraph": 22, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 25, "bbox": [151.71, 567.91, 481.54, 581.38], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["The World Bank and the IMF are also helping the countries most affected.", {"paragraph": 23, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 26, "bbox": [151.71, 586.12, 476.33, 599.59], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["These are fine examples of international solidarity that bode well for the future.", {"paragraph": 24, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 27, "bbox": [151.71, 604.34, 490.94, 617.81], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["But if we’re truly going to defeat this virus we’ll have to do even more to enhance international cooperation.", {"paragraph": 25, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 28, "bbox": [123.36, 622.55, 493.63, 648.24], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["It starts with supporting the World Health Organization, which plays a crucial role.", {"paragraph": 26, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 29, "bbox": [123.36, 652.99, 499.74, 678.67], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["We must provide the resources it needs.", {"paragraph": 27, "pdf_page": 23, "pdf_block": 30, "bbox": [151.71, 683.42, 324.75, 696.89], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["It also means countries need to give the Organization full cooperation and show transparency.", {"paragraph": 28, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 2, "bbox": [123.36, 83.65, 493.58, 109.95], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["In some cases this has been lacking.", {"paragraph": 29, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 3, "bbox": [151.71, 115.31, 309.46, 128.78], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["At the same time, the WHO has also attracted criticism.", {"paragraph": 30, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 4, "bbox": [151.71, 134.13, 395.9, 147.6], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["The Netherlands agrees that — once the crisis is under control — we should evaluate the situation and look at how we can enhance its powers.", {"paragraph": 31, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 5, "bbox": [123.36, 152.96, 493.58, 179.26], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["So that we’re well-equipped to deal with — or better still prevent — any future pandemic.", {"paragraph": 32, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 6, "bbox": [123.36, 184.61, 493.6, 210.91], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Critical evaluation and continuous efforts to improve are key elements of multilateral cooperation.", {"paragraph": 33, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 7, "bbox": [123.36, 216.27, 493.56, 242.57], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["But unfortunately, as we mark the UN’s 75th anniversary, we’re also seeing another trend.", {"paragraph": 34, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 8, "bbox": [123.36, 247.92, 493.54, 274.22], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["The multilateral world order, which has given us so much in the decades since World War Two, is under great pressure.", {"paragraph": 35, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 9, "bbox": [123.36, 279.58, 493.61, 305.87], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["And we need to turn this tide.", {"paragraph": 36, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 10, "bbox": [151.71, 311.23, 281.89, 324.7], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Step one is for all countries to take responsibility for the proper functioning of the multilateral system.", {"paragraph": 37, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 11, "bbox": [123.36, 330.06, 493.52, 356.35], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Take a constructive approach.", {"paragraph": 38, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 12, "bbox": [151.71, 361.71, 281.89, 375.18], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Stand up for your own interests, but don’t lose sight of the common interest.", {"paragraph": 39, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 13, "bbox": [151.71, 380.54, 483.29, 394.01], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["And last but not least, honour the agreements we’ve made and respect international law, including human rights. When it comes to multilateralism, you can’t pick and choose.", {"paragraph": 40, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 14, "bbox": [123.36, 399.36, 493.63, 438.49], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Step two is to critically assess the system itself.", {"paragraph": 41, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 15, "bbox": [151.71, 443.84, 359.55, 457.31], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Because there’s work to be done there too.", {"paragraph": 42, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 16, "bbox": [151.71, 462.67, 335.94, 476.14], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["We can’t tackle today’s challenges with yesterday’s structures.", {"paragraph": 43, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 17, "bbox": [151.71, 481.5, 424.12, 494.97], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["It’s essential that we improve, reform and modernise our global institutions.", {"paragraph": 44, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 18, "bbox": [151.71, 500.32, 482.86, 513.79], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["And the UN is no exception.", {"paragraph": 45, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 19, "bbox": [151.71, 519.15, 276.07, 532.62], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["During our recent membership of the UN Security Council, the Netherlands worked hard on practical UN reforms in the area of peacekeeping.", {"paragraph": 46, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 20, "bbox": [123.36, 537.98, 493.6, 564.28], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["And we fully support the broad reform agenda of SecretaryGeneral Guterres.", {"paragraph": 47, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 21, "bbox": [151.71, 569.63, 489.04, 583.1], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Together we need to ensure that the UN — now 75 years old — remains fit for purpose, well-equipped and young at heart.", {"paragraph": 48, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 22, "bbox": [123.36, 588.46, 493.6, 614.76], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["That it’s ready for the next 75 years.", {"paragraph": 49, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 23, "bbox": [151.71, 620.11, 308.99, 633.58], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Because the new generations, who are already making their voices heard, must be able to count on a solid global system of multilateral cooperation.", {"paragraph": 50, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 24, "bbox": [123.36, 638.94, 493.52, 665.24], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["The Kingdom of the Netherlands will keep working towards that end, in every way possible.", {"paragraph": 51, "pdf_page": 24, "pdf_block": 25, "bbox": [123.36, 670.59, 493.57, 696.89], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["By providing financial resources, for example: we are one of the ten biggest donors to the multilateral system and we try to play a constructive role.", {"paragraph": 52, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 2, "bbox": [123.36, 83.65, 493.58, 109.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["But also by sharing our expertise in areas like climate adaptation.", {"paragraph": 53, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 3, "bbox": [151.71, 113.65, 438.83, 127.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["A topic that’s in the very DNA of our Kingdom, which is made up of a lowlying delta by the North Sea and several small islands in the Caribbean.", {"paragraph": 54, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 4, "bbox": [123.36, 131.65, 491.0, 157.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["In January 2021, we will be hosting the Climate Adaptation Summit to help the world prepare better for the effects of climate change.", {"paragraph": 55, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 5, "bbox": [123.36, 161.65, 493.53, 187.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Another contribution we make is providing a base for the international legal order.", {"paragraph": 56, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 6, "bbox": [123.36, 191.65, 499.68, 217.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["My home town of The Hague is host to the International Court of Justice and the International Criminal Court, for example.", {"paragraph": 57, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 7, "bbox": [123.36, 221.65, 493.54, 247.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["We must continue supporting these crucial institutions.", {"paragraph": 58, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 8, "bbox": [151.71, 251.65, 392.86, 265.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Even though it’s become harder and harder in recent years to achieve accountability, due mainly to resistance from a small number of countries.", {"paragraph": 59, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 9, "bbox": [123.36, 269.65, 493.57, 295.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["But we won’t let that stop us.", {"paragraph": 60, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 10, "bbox": [151.71, 299.65, 278.1, 313.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["We will find other ways.", {"paragraph": 61, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 11, "bbox": [151.71, 317.65, 259.16, 331.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Like the international mechanism for collecting and analysing evidence of the most serious crimes committed in Syria.", {"paragraph": 62, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 12, "bbox": [123.36, 335.65, 493.57, 361.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Or the step the Netherlands recently took, holding Syria formally responsible for human rights violations.", {"paragraph": 63, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 13, "bbox": [123.36, 365.65, 493.53, 391.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["And for our country in particular, the establishment of special court proceedings to try those accused of downing flight MH17 was a major milestone.", {"paragraph": 64, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 14, "bbox": [123.36, 395.65, 493.54, 421.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Because justice must be served.", {"paragraph": 65, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 15, "bbox": [151.71, 425.65, 290.17, 439.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["And because justice is a central pillar of our multilateral world order.", {"paragraph": 66, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 16, "bbox": [151.71, 443.65, 453.73, 457.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["We work in all these areas, in the full conviction that international cooperation brings us progress.", {"paragraph": 67, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 17, "bbox": [123.36, 461.65, 493.57, 487.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["And although the current crisis forces us to keep our distance, now more than ever we need to come closer together.", {"paragraph": 68, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 18, "bbox": [123.36, 491.65, 493.53, 517.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}], ["Thank you.", {"paragraph": 69, "pdf_page": 25, "pdf_block": 19, "bbox": [151.71, 521.65, 201.24, 535.12], "origin_file": "data/unga_general_debate_verbatim_en/UNGA75_2020/A_75_PV_10_EN.pdf", "origin_sha256": "4ebd1482c4303c824ad48eb685efaf89fed2894ca72a07a4546eec9edcae78f0"}]]}